{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Add a new 'UNDEPLOYED' state to the existing Mesos SPI status enumeration and map relevant Mesos task lifecycle events to it instead of using 'UNKNOWN'.",
    "Expose a new REST resource/endpoint that delegates to the existing RabbitBindingCleaner component, following the project's standard REST conventions and security model.",
    "Optimize the YARN deployer by parallelizing per-module deployment requests and reusing established YARN application master sessions rather than redeploying the whole stream serially.",
    "Manage all third-party version upgrades (SHDP, Spring Integration, Spring Boot, Spring Cloud Build) through the central dependency BOM/parent POM to maintain consistency and backward compatibility.",
    "For the Kafka bus, introduce/respect a partitioning key configuration that is applied even when there is a single downstream module, delegating partitioning to Kafka's native partitioner.",
    "Keep public APIs backward compatible; deprecate old behavior instead of removing it, and add documentation for HSQL DB composed-job limitations in the existing reference guide (AsciiDoc)."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The developer is already familiar with the codebase and has a working build environment with the appropriate JDK and Maven/Gradle installed.",
    "The RabbitBindingCleaner class is already implemented and only lacks a REST invocation path.",
    "Version upgrades (SHDP 2.2.1, SI 4.2.2, Boot, Spring Cloud Build) do not introduce major breaking API changes; any required code adjustments are minor and included in the estimates.",
    "Existing automated unit and integration test infrastructure can be used locally to validate changes.",
    "Effort estimates represent a single developer's hands-on development and testing time, excluding external code review, project management, and production deployment.",
